{
  "name": "Monthly Sitara price updates to match counterparty invoices",
  "today": "On a few deals the monthly price is simply whatever the counterparty invoice or the pipeline statement says (EnerVest Sitara #27239, deal #27253, Peoples/North Shore transport deals #131389/#131405). Each month the settlements analyst gets the invoice, emails Darron Giron asking him to change the price in Sitara, waits for his reply (sometimes sending a reminder), and only then redrafts the invoice. From March 2001 Darron passed these requests on to Kristen Clause, which adds another hand-off.",
  "change": "Let settlements enter the invoiced price themselves on a short list of flagged pass-through deals, with the desk reviewing a monthly list afterwards.",
  "explanation": "Mark the few deals whose monthly price is set by the counterparty invoice or pipeline statement as 'invoice-actualized' in Sitara and give the settlements analysts who own them rights to update the price on those deals only, with the invoice or statement attached. Settlements enters the figure and redrafts right away. Once a month the desk lead gets a list of the changes made and checks them. The emailed request, the wait, the reminders and the 'let me know when done' replies go away. The keying itself moves to settlements and is not counted as saved.",
  "occurrences": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/508.eml",
      "quote": "I've already received invoice for 9/00 production.  Could you please change \nits price to 4.417791 (S#27239)?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/469.eml",
      "quote": "Could you please change rate on the above Sitara to $4.878216 for Oct. 00 \nproduction?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/378.eml",
      "quote": "Could you please change rate on the above Sitara to $4.15544 for Nov. 00 \nProduction ?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/301.eml",
      "quote": "As usual, could you please change rate on S# 27239 for 12/00 production to \n$5.811329?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/141.eml",
      "quote": "Could you please help me change the rate for the above Sitara # for Jan. 01 \nproduction to $9.624065?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/81.eml",
      "quote": "The customer invoiced ENA a price of $2.3043. Can you please \nupdate the deal in Sitara to reflect the correct price for 03/01?"
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/12.eml",
      "quote": "It \ncurrently has a rate of $2.3043 (last month's price). The customer invoiced a \nrate of $1.8351."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/762.eml",
      "quote": "Can you update for transport?  Sitara #131389 (North Shore) and #131405 \n(Peoples)."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/738.eml",
      "quote": "Please update the Sitara demand charges on the following deals to match the \nactualized pipeline statements:"
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/738.eml",
      "quote": "Please notify me when complete so I can redraft Unify.",
      "note": "Settlements cannot redraft until the desk confirms the change, so each request needs a round trip of emails."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/313.eml",
      "quote": "This is just a friendly reminder.....",
      "note": "Requests sometimes need a chaser; this one was sent nine days after the request."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/141.eml",
      "quote": "Please send these to Kristen Clause in the future.",
      "note": "The desk lead passes the work on to a delegate, adding another hand-off without adding any check that the invoice does not already give."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/301.eml",
      "quote": "As usual, could you please change rate on S# 27239 for 12/00 production",
      "note": "The request is routine: the new price is just the invoiced figure."
    }
  ],
  "stalls": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/508.eml",
      "quote": "It's done.  I appologize for this taking so long.  It won't happen again.",
      "note": "The 9/00 EnerVest price change asked for on 10/23 was done only around 11/13, after two follow-ups and a hand-over between staff, holding up settlement of that month."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/717.eml",
      "quote": "Have you had a chance to look at this adjustment to $.1134?  Sitara still \nshows .0556.",
      "note": "On a Peoples spot deal, a revised rate sent on 7/19 was still not in Sitara on 8/03, and settlements needed it for the invoice going out the next day."
    }
  ],
  "ongoing": true,
  "stated_rate": null,
  "minutes": 9
}

