  "change": "Pre-fill each cost center's hours by activity and commercial-team percentage splits with last month's values so managers only edit what changed.",
  "reason": "The mail never shows managers re-entering unchanged hours or team splits in the Access tool: it says commercial teams and FTEs roll over each month, shows prior-month hours in a report, and says nothing about how hours are entered or how long it takes, so the 8 minutes x 37 managers and the 2 split follow-ups a month (the mailbox shows one in Oct 2000 and one in Aug 2001, both caused by a missing prompt rather than re-entry) are guesses.",
